{:edb/db-before-t 1567 :edb/db-after-t 1568 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534880 50 #inst "2026-10-12T22:24:17.488Z" 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186133272 1075 #edb/ref 17592186133274 13194139534880 17592186045417 false] [17592186133272 1075 #edb/ref 17592186133275 13194139534880 17592186045417 false] [17592186133272 1075 #edb/ref 17592186133277 13194139534880 17592186045417 false] [17592186133272 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442304 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186133272 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442314 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186133272 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442317 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186133272 1078 #edb/ref 17592186442304 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186133727 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442323 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186133728 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442324 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186133728 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442325 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186133729 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442322 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186134539 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186134539 1071 "Given that the random variable $X$ has the cumulative distribution function\n\n$$\nF(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}0, & x<0 \\\\ 1-{e}^{-x}, & x\\ge 0,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfind $P(X>2).$" 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186134539 1071 "Given that the random variable $X$ has the cumulative distribution function\n$F(x) = {0,\\begin{vmatrix}x < 0 \\\\ 1 - e^{-x},\\end{vmatrix}x \\ge 0$,\n\nfind $P(X > 2)$." 13194139534880 17592186045417 false] [17592186134539 1074 "We can perform this computation using the complement, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X>2) & =1-P(X\\le 2) \\\\  & =1-F(2) \\\\  & =1-(1-{e}^{-2}) \\\\  & ={e}^{-2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{e}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186442302 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442326 13194139534880 17592186045417 true] [17592186442302 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442327 13194139